{% set p1 %}{% t %}Prospektor finds the companies worth approaching, names who to talk to and writes what you send them, in your voice. One press files all of it in HighLevel, where your follow-up already runs.{% endt %}{% endset %}
{% set p2 %}{% t %}Each decision-maker with a work email becomes a <strong>Contact</strong> with the company's name and website, and the first gets a <strong>Note</strong> with the case for the company. Anyone already there is found and left as they are.{% endt %}{% endset %}
{% set p3 %}{% t %}Every contact we create is tagged <strong>prospektor</strong>, so a workflow of yours can pick it up: start a sequence, open an opportunity in your own pipeline, assign an owner. The button beside the pitch opens the contact in HighLevel.{% endt %}{% endset %}
{% set s1 %}{% t %}Inside the sub-account, open <strong>Settings → Private Integrations</strong>, create one with view and edit on Contacts and view on Locations, and copy the token.{% endt %}{% endset %}
{% set s2 %}{% t %}Copy the sub-account's Location ID from <strong>Settings → Business Profile</strong>.{% endt %}{% endset %}
{% set s3 %}{% t %}Paste both under <strong>Connect your apps</strong> in your workspace settings, press <strong>Connect</strong>, then press <strong>Push to HighLevel</strong> on a finished pitch.{% endt %}{% endset %}
{% set pExtra %}{% t %}Running an agency? Connect the sub-account of the client you prospect for, and their pitches land in their own HighLevel.{% endt %}{% endset %}
